loopcatcher (0.2.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add English/Spanish translations for the whole app (Settings ->
    Advanced -> Language, auto-detected on first run).
  * Reduce the CLI to --help/--version/--debug/--logname - output
    directory, session name, codec, bitrate and filename scheme are now
    config/TUI-only (Settings, Session Name screen).
  * Settings/Profile Settings edits still save to disk immediately, but no
    longer reload into the running process - use the new Restart item on
    the Welcome menu to apply them.
  * Fix Ctrl+C on the Recording screen silently exiting without showing
    the Finish screen.

 -- Kike Fonseca <filipok@gmail.com>  Mon, 31 Aug 2026 18:00:00 +0000

loopcatcher (0.2.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Split the Spotify-specific logic out into a loadable profile module
    (profiles/spotify_native), the first step of a modular, multi-player
    architecture - the fixed Welcome/Settings/Session Name/Finish screens
    and the encoding engine now stay in the main script regardless of
    which profile is active.
  * Add a Profile menu (Change Profile / Profile Settings / About Profile)
    and an Enabled Profiles setting to the Welcome screen.
  * Rename the log_directory config key to log_file_path (now a full file
    path instead of a directory).
  * Drop the "custom" MPRIS player profile for this release - a dedicated
    generic-MPRIS module is planned for a future release.

 -- Kike Fonseca <filipok@gmail.com>  Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000

